## 6. Data Retention and Disposal Policy

### 6.1. Retention Periods
- Active Data: 30 days
- Backup Data: 7 days
- Log Records: 90 days
- System Metrics: 180 days

### 6.2. Data Disposal Methods

#### 6.2.1. Deletion
- Software deletion
- Physical deletion
- Cryptographic deletion

#### 6.2.2. Destruction
- Physical destruction
- De-magnetization
- Overwriting

#### 6.2.3. Anonymization
- Masking
- Data derivation
- Aggregation

